        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "设置身份验证器" } }
      }
    },
    "Single-use, expires in about %@ min." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "仅可使用一次，约 %@ 分钟后过期。" } }
      }
    },
    "Step 1: Verify your email · Step 2: Create your account" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "第 1 步：验证邮箱 · 第 2 步：创建账号" } }
      }
    },
    "Store these somewhere safe. Each code works once if you lose your authenticator." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "请妥善保存。如果无法使用身份验证器，每个代码可使用一次。" } }
      }
    },
    "This cannot be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "此操作无法撤销。" } }
      }
    },
    "This disconnects the bot and stops it from handling new work until it is enabled again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "这会断开机器人连接，并停止处理新任务，直到再次启用。" } }
      }
    },
    "This permanently disables your account, revokes sessions and push notifications, anonymizes your profile, and disables bots you own. Shared workspaces are transferred or archived." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "这会永久停用账号、撤销会话和推送通知、匿名化个人资料，并停用你拥有的机器人。共享工作区将被转移或归档。" } }
      }
    },
    "This revokes your sessions on this server." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "这会撤销你在此服务器上的会话。" } }
      }
    },
    "To DM a person, add them in Friends first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "要向某人发送私信，请先在“好友”中添加对方。" } }
      }
    },
    "To switch servers, sign out and sign back in with a different server URL." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "如需切换服务器，请退出登录并使用其他服务器 URL 重新登录。" } }
      }
    },
    "Two pieces: a settings file (safe to keep) and a token — that one is a password, so save it where only you can read it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "包含两部分：可安全保存的设置文件和令牌。令牌相当于密码，请保存在只有你能读取的位置。" } }
      }
    },
    "Use at least 12 characters." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "至少使用 12 个字符。" } }
      }
    },
    "Use at least 12 characters. A longer, unique passphrase is recommended." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "至少使用 12 个字符。建议使用更长且唯一的密码短语。" } }
      }
    },
    "User ID" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "用户 ID" } }
      }
    },
